# --- Upstream source, not vendored -------------------------------------------
# Fetched fresh at the pinned commits (see docs/INVESTIGATION.md and the CI
# workflow). Kept out of the repo so history stays small and the GPLv2/EPL
# source boundary stays clean.
/upstream/

# --- Local working area ------------------------------------------------------
# Build output, deployable trees, test games, emulator and reference runtimes.
# All generated or third-party; none of it belongs in the repository.
/workspace/

# --- Build artifacts ---------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.elf
EBOOT.PBP
PARAM.SFO
**/output/
/m3g/obj/
/m3g/lib/
/m3g/test/obj/
/m3g/test/m3g_load_test
/m3g/test/m3g_render_test

